00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.870
- Card games, heads up...

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:28.450
- Like spades, gin rummy,
like that kind of thing?

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:29.460
- Like speed. Do you...

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.560
