00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.043
- Yeah.

00:00:34.043 --> 00:00:34.876
- And...

00:00:34.876 --> 00:00:35.750
- I'm actually pretty good.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:36.583
- Are you?

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:37.686
- Yeah.

00:00:37.686 --> 00:00:38.519
- So am I.

00:00:38.519 --> 00:00:40.680
- Yeah. Pretty good
Elizabeth, just saying.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.513
- So am I.

00:00:41.513 --> 00:00:42.580
- But y'all would play all the time?

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.503
- We would. We would
play games all the time.

00:00:43.503 --> 00:00:45.410
We would literally work all day,

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.130
