00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.420
We'd stay like till like 2
in the morning sometimes.

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.365
- Oh.

00:00:54.365 --> 00:00:55.198
- Just playing and playing and playing.

00:00:55.198 --> 00:00:57.140
And we'd be like just one more game,

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.310
