00:01:09.752 --> 00:01:10.585
(laughing)

00:01:10.585 --> 00:01:12.200
- It's... You would be correct.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.033
- That's amazing.

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:13.930
