00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:19.920
And we played and we played and we played.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.203
I did not loose.

00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:23.479
- Yes.

00:01:23.479 --> 00:01:24.312
